<section class="mt-page"><div class="mt-page-header"><div><p class="mt-eyebrow">ORGANIZATION</p><h1>Branches</h1><p>Locations share medicine definitions while inventory remains branch-specific.</p></div></div><div class="mt-two-column"><article class="mt-panel"><div class="mt-panel-header"><div><h2>Locations</h2></div></div><div class="mt-table-wrap"><table class="mt-table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Code</th><th>Phone</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each branchList}}<tr><td><strong>{{name}}</strong><small class="mt-cell-sub">{{address}}</small></td><td><span class="mt-code">{{code}}</span></td><td>{{phone}}</td><td><span class="mt-status {{#if active}}mt-status-success{{else}}mt-status-danger{{/if}}">{{#if active}}Active{{else}}Inactive{{/if}}</span></td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></article><article class="mt-panel mt-form-panel"><div class="mt-panel-header"><div><h2>Add branch</h2><p>A default register is created automatically.</p></div></div><form method="post" class="mt-panel-body mt-form-stack"><label>Branch name<input name="name" required></label><label>Code<input name="code" maxlength="40" placeholder="CITY01" required></label><label>Phone<input name="phone"></label><label>Address<textarea name="address"></textarea></label><button class="mt-btn mt-btn-primary">Create branch</button></form></article></div></section>